OL,3,GNEWSAHow city's market became a
OL,4,ACBeebies TV set
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoventry Market's fruit and vegetable
OL,7,Fstalls, fish counters and busy walkways
OL,8,Fhave become an unlikely TV set.
OL,10,FCameras are rolling among shoppers and
OL,11,Ftraders as local children explore
OL,12,Funfamiliar foods for a new CBeebies
OL,13,Fseries.
OL,15,FI Can Taste It aims to help three to
OL,16,Fsix-year-olds build confidence in
OL,17,Ftrying different foods through sight,
OL,18,Fsmell, touch, sound and taste.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
