OL,3,GNEWSAHow city's market became a
OL,4,ACBeebies TV set
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresented by Aaron Roach Bridgeman and
OL,7,Fpuppet co-host Zesty, the programme is
OL,8,Fbeing filmed at the market, which
OL,9,Fproducers say offers children an
OL,10,Fauthentic environment in which to learn
OL,11,Fabout food.
